window.products.push({"id":153085,"name":"BestEquip Ice Making Machine Commercial (40KG/110lb)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vAcvQI4XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ice Making Machine Commercial 40-50kg (88-110lb) per 24h Stainless Steel 110V Ice Maker 4*8 Cube Made of food-grade stainless steel, our 40-50kg (88-110lb) Commercial Ice Making Machine is durable, sanitary, and easy to clean. It is equipped with digital control panel and owns the ability to set time of making ice in advance. In addition, it has good insulation effect thanks to its super-thick foam layer and cyclopentane insulation layer. Perfect for coffee shops, hotels, bars, KTV, supermarkets, bakeries, restaurants, cold drinks shops, laboratories, schools, hospitals and other places. Advantages -Heat insulation for 5-7 hours in case of power failure. -Digital control panel, setting time in advance. -Eco-friendly rubber tube of longevity. Unobstructed draining. -Multi-grid ice plate for higher efficiency. -Fully automatic operation, no off-smell -Refrigerant?R404a Note -When the water temperature is under 5°C / 41?, the machine probably can make ice up to 200 kg / 440 lbs in 24 hours. In other words, the ice quantity obviously depends on water temperature. -When you receive the machine, please place it for 24 hours before use. This action can prevent the freezing oil in the compressor from going into the tube which may damage the compressor and impact the cooling effect. Specifications -Material?Stainless steel -Voltage?110V -Item Weight?25.4 kg (56 lb) -Item Dimensions?70* 52* 46 cm (27.6\"* 20.1\"* 18.1\") -Ice Cube Size?0.9\" x 0.9\" x 0.9\" / 22 x 22 x 22mm -Ice Making Capacity?40-50kg (88-110lb) per 24h -Condensation: Air cooling -Refrigerant?R404a -Single Ice Plate: 32 cases (4* 8) Package Content1×40-50kg (88-110lb) Commercial Ice Making Machine; 1× Ice Spoon; 1× Water Inlet; 1× Water Outlet; 1× Water Filter; 1× User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vAcvQI4XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestEquip","source_asin":"B07GMK6TGF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-153085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GMK6TGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GMK6TGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
