window.products.push({"id":153211,"name":"Danby Silhouette Select 30\" Stainless Steel Wall-Mount Range Hood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hiaKhrv2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description Danby Stainless Steel Chimney Style Hood Range Hood DWRH301SSST. Provide exceptional task lighting while cooking. Once activated the fan will continue to run for 5 minutes to clear residual vapors and then shut off. If the range hood is off and the cooking surface temperature reaches 158 *F, it will automatically turn on to the highest fan setting. If already on, it will increase the fan speed to high. Material: Stainless Steel. Style: Chimney Wall-Mount. Fan Speeds: 3. CFM: 500. Controls: 4 Buttons with LED Display. Sones (Hi / Med / Low): 4.3 / 1.9 / 1.1. Delay Off Timer: Yes. Filter Type: Mesh and Steel. Clean Filter Indicator: Illuminates After 100 Hrs. of Use. Heat Sensor: Yes. Width: 29 3/4. Depth: 19 11/16. Height: 14 3/16. Danby's commitment is to provide exceptional quality and value with a continued dedication for creating innovative, unique products that are designed to fit your lifestyle. Danby was founded in 1947, as a manufacturer of small electrical appliances and compact refrigerators. 2007 marked Danby's 60th year in the business of providing quality products to the North American market. Today, Danby is one of North America's largest household appliance marketing companies boasting an impressive line-up of compact, specialty and home comfort appliances to suit the lifestyles of today's consumers. Danby's reputation as a leader in the appliance market has been achieved by researching what consumers want and providing quality innovative products at competitive prices to fit their lifestyles. From the Manufacturer Silhouette Select�s 30� chimney-style wall mount range hood is sure to turn your kitchen into a modern and sophisticated space with its stainless steel finish. This range hood has dual centrifugal fans, a heat sensor and an auto-off function. It also has dual halogen lights and an easily accessible front mount control panel with LED display and back-lit buttons for easy operation. Boasting 3 powerful fan speeds, this unit exhausts up to 500 cfm. It also includes an auto clean filter reminder and a dishwasher safe aluminum mesh filter and is backed by an industry leading 2 year parts and labor warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hiaKhrv2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silhouette Select","source_asin":"B00891PKPC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-153211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00891PKPC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00891PKPC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
