window.products.push({"id":153302,"name":"COSTWAY Nugget Ice Maker Countertop, 60 Lbs/24H, Self Dispensing Ice 3.3 Lbs in 5 Mins Continuously, Pebble Ice Machine with Self-Cleaning Function, 9","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":459.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e+MI9cL+L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description Enjoy chewable and crunchy nugget ice with our self dispensing ice maker! This ice making machine features 2 hoses. One is the water inlet hose with a water filter for you to use it connect to the faucet. Another one is the water drain hose that can be used for both drainage outlets based on the corresponding situation. After that, you can press the “MAKING ICE” button. In 1 cycle, it will cost 20 mins in low temp or 45 mins in high temp. And this ice maker produces 60 lbs of nugget ice per day and holds up to 9 lbs at a time. And the built-in blue light allows you to check the ice. Then, the “DISPENSE ICE” button for dispensing ice 30s and the “LARGE/CLEAN” button for dispensing ice 5 minutes are available. Different from cube ice and bullet ice, the nugget ice is more chewable and crunchy, which is perfect for different drinks. What’s more, the self-cleaning function will always be online, just press the “LARGE/CLEAN” button for 3s. Feature Take 20 mins in low temp or 45 mins in high temp in 1 cycle The ice storage capacity is up to 9 lbs Convenient to observe the nugget ice with built-in LED blue light Connect the faucet with the ice maker through the water inlet hose Turn the tap water to pure water thanks to its water filter 5 minutes self-cleaning function for great convenience The drain hose should be connected to the upper drainage outlet during self-cleaning In operation times, the drain hose should connect to the lower drainage outlet Prevent the drain hose from falling off by fixing accessories Dispense ice for 30s by pressing the “DISPENSE ICE” button Dispense ice for 5 minutes by pressing the “DISPENSE ICE” button Press the “DISPENSE ICE” button for 3s if the ice gets stuck The advanced infrared sensing technology detects whether the ice is full or not Equipped with water level sensor as well Crunchy and chewable nugget ice for rapid chilling and slow melting Safe to use with ETL and FDA certifications Quiet operation to avoid disruption Made of premium stainless steel for higher durabilityRemovable drip tray to collect water Specification Color: Black+Silver Material: ABS, Stainless Steel Overall Dimension: 20” x 12” x 22” (L x W x H) Length of Power Cord: 6 ft Net Weight: 53 lbsIce Making Capacity (24H): 60 lbsIce Storage Capacity: 9 lbsIce Making Time: 20 Mins (Low Temp)/45 Mins (High Temp)Operating Temp: 37℉-104℉Water supply pressure：0.1-0.4mpa.Rated Voltage: AC 120V/60Hz Wattage: 240W Rated Current: 3A Climate Type: SN/N/ST Water Supply Pressure: 0.1-0.4MPaPackage Includes: 1 x Ice Maker1 x Ice Scoop 1 x Water Filter Hose 1 x Drain Hose 1 x Bag of Fixing Accessories 1 x Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e+MI9cL+L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B0BZ4G1V1J","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-153302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ4G1V1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ4G1V1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
