window.products.push({"id":153461,"name":"PAKROMAN 400LB/24H Commercial Ice Maker Machine, 300LB Large Storage Bin, 1201W SECOP Compressor, ETL Listed, ETL Sanitation Listed, CE, CEC, Air Cool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613SYIbToRL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"UPSCALE ICE MAKER: Looking for a Top-Quality, ETL LISTED, and ETL SANITATION LISTED commercial ice maker machine? PAKROMAN is perfect for you！ These ice machines come with SECOP compressors and 1201V Power, Plus they are CE and CEC Approved. It is capable of producing 400 lbs of ice in 24 hours and quickly makes 156 pieces of clear ice in one cycle within 12-18 mins, his type of ice machine is perfect for businesses such as restaurants, bars, and hotels. MAGNETIC DOOR PANEL: Flush-opening cabinet doors in magnetic mode are opened by simply pushing on the door, This makes it very easy to access the ice machine's interior, which is important for both cleaning and filling purposes. Additionally, because the doors are held shut by magnets, there's no need for complex locking mechanisms or handles, which can often break or become difficult to use over time. LCD INTELLIGENT PANEL & AUTOMATIC CLEANING: LCD Intelligent panel makes it easy to select the time and thickness of the ice cubes, as well as the different modes that the machine has, One-Click Appointment, the machine will automatically stop when the ice bin is full. The self-cleaning function can help to prolong the life of your ice machine, by keeping the interior clean you won't have to worry about parts becoming corroded or damaged EFFECTIVE INSULATION: Our products have PE injection liner, 40MM integral foam layer, Stainless Steel Outer layer, Food grade material for the whole body, and ETL-approved devices that reduce safety hazards, Poorly insulated ice maker machines can result in lower ice production, as well as higher energy bills PERFECT AFTER-SALES SERVICE: Three-year product warranty and a five-year compressor warranty !! We have our own local distribution team in the USA, any problems can be directly called our after-sales number, We also offer a wide range of support services, including maintenance. Note: Our complimentary filters only provide primary filtration, for edible ice and longer life you should use a more advanced filter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613SYIbToRL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PAKROMAN","source_asin":"B0BY8GKDF8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-153461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY8GKDF8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY8GKDF8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
