window.products.push({"id":153929,"name":"Summit CR2B23T3B 12\" Wide 230V 2-Burner Radiant Cooktop, Smooth Black Ceramic Glass, 3000W, Safety Automatic Shutoff, Child Lock, ADA Compliant, Easy ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":339.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615WV6+MWIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Versatile Cooking Options: Experience easy cleanup and elevate your kitchen with the CR2B23T3B 12\" Wide 230V 2-Burner Radiant Cooktop. Not only is this cooktop great for residential kitchens but it’s also ideal for hotel suites. Its Schott glass surface provides a smooth and elegant ceramic glass finish in jet black. The rear 7\" burner of this cooktop packs a punch with 1800W of power, allowing for faster heating of larger cooking vessels. Meet your everyday cooking needs with the front 5.5\" standard burner. With 1200W of power, it offers efficient heating and perfectly cooks your dishes. Convenient Features: Simplify your cooking experience with the digital touch controls of this cooktop. The intuitive control panel and digital display make selecting and adjusting your desired heat levels effortless. The residual heat indicator alerts you if the surface is too hot to touch, ensuring your safety. The timer function allows you to program specific heating levels for up to 99 minutes, giving you precise control over your cooking. Additional features like the child lock, automatic shutoff, and unintended operation protection provide peace of mind and make this cooktop suitable for all users. Enhanced Safety Features: Your safety is our priority. This cooktop offers a range of safety features, including residual heat indicator lights that warn you if the surface is still hot. The ADA-compliant upfront controls ensure easy accessibility, while the child lock prevents unsupervised heating. Moreover, the automatic shutoff feature turns off the burner if no changes are made within two hours. Reliable Performance and Easy Installation: Designed for built-in installation, this cooktop is designed to fit popular 10 3/4\" W x 19 7/8\" D counter cutouts. Its 230V operation requires the professional hardwired installation to a dedicated power supply. Its easy-fitting size and lasting durability make it the perfect cooktop for small homes, apartments, tiny houses, hotel suites, and other smaller kitchen spaces. Rest assured, the safety cut-off function ensures the cooktop automatically turns off if left untouched for one minute without selecting a power level. Summit Appliance: Summit Appliance is a US-owned and based company, family-run since 1969. We currently have one of the largest selections of cooktops in the industry. Part of our extensive cooktop collection includes a sizable selection of European gas cooktops ensuring that you find a cooktop that will be your perfect fit and enhance your kitchen. All cooktops are covered by our Summit Appliance Warranty, please contact us to find the warranty information. Please contact us for missing parts, do not return the entire unit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615WV6+MWIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Summit Appliance","source_asin":"B0C1HS9GWD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-153929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1HS9GWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1HS9GWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
