window.products.push({"id":153964,"name":"POTFYA Double Induction Cooktop 24 Inch, 4000W 2 Burners Induction Cooktop, Portable Electric Cooktop 110v, Countertop Burner Electric Stove 9 Levels ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ycsgc-LCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Double Fire Power】The 2 burners induction cooktop portable has two separate cooking zones 2000W+2000W and can adjust its fire separately. We can stir-fry and cook noodles to achieve the effect of rapid cooking at the same time, making the most delicious meals in the shortest time, greatly saving us time. It is very suitable for large family gatherings or outdoor camping. 【Perfect Function】The double induction cooktop is divided into three different adjustment functions, F, C is the temperature adjustment, the range of F gear is 176 ℉ to 510 ℉, and C gear is from 80 ℃ to 270 ℃. W gear has 9 power levels that are from 400w to 2000w. It also contains child safety locks and high and low-voltage warning systems that can ensure our security. Besides, it includes a three-hour extra-long timer function that can meet our daily life. 【Distinctive Color】This 2 burner induction cooktop is in an understated and simple gray color, the unique color that reflects the different feel of the product and adds a touch of premium color to the entire kitchen, impressing us without notice and increasing our sense of well-being and experience when using it. 【Dimension and Quality】The size of the sensor touch control induction cooker is 23.62*14.17*3.15 inches, which has lightweight and perfect dimension, very suitable for daily use, simple and safe, and brings you peace of mind. The surface adopts high-quality glass, easy to clean just wipe it with one wet cloth. 【Compatible Cookware】The 4000w countertop induction cooktop relies on induction heating, so they are only suitable for cast iron, iron, steel, or enameled iron pots and pans. You can use a magnet to test if the cookware is compatible. If the magnet sticks to the bottom of the pan, it is compatible. Please install it according to the product manual and contact us at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ycsgc-LCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POTFYA","source_asin":"B0CG5DV3NP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-153964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CG5DV3NP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CG5DV3NP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
